      "content": "WARNING:  Performance  Verification.  Do  not  place  the  N5500  into  operation after repair or maintenance has been performed, until all Performance Tests and Safety  Tests  listed  in  Section  3  of  this  service   manual  have  been  performed. Failure to perform all tests could result in erroneous monitor readings."
