        "r": 533.8151999999999,
        "b": 431.4375
      },
      "content": "WARNING: Before attempting to open or disassemble the N5500, disconnect the power cord from the N5500."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0616",
      "reading_order": 677,
      "section": "Section 6: Disassembly Guide",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.49887499999994,
        "t": 414.8025,
        "r": 539.06175,
        "b": 387.9375
      },
      "content": "CAUTION:  Observe  ESD  (electrostatic  discharge)  precautions  when  working within the unit."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0617",
      "reading_order": 678,
      "section": "Section 6: Disassembly Guide",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.49887499999994,
        "t": 375.75375,
        "r": 539.0617500000001,
        "b": 349.49625
      },
      "content": "Note:  Some  spare  parts  have  a  business  reply  card  attached.  When  you  receive  these spare parts, please fill out and return the card."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0618",
      "reading_order": 679,
      "section": "6.1    General",
      "bbox": {
